{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"The dimension table is now locked. I’m taking the large-bore centre as `(0, 0)` and the bore axes as Z.\n\n| Feature | Dimensions / positions, mm |\n|---|---|\n| Large hub | Ø55 outside, Ø40 through, 40 axial width |\n| Three small bosses | Ø20 outside, Ø13 through; centres `(104.1, −18.5)`, `(123.2, 35.9)`, `(161.3, 20.4)` |\n| Main body / pockets | 24 overall thickness; 7-deep recesses on each side; 10 central web |\n| Axial steps | 29 at the lower boss; 25 at the end-link bosses; 20 across the narrowed end-link region |\n| Main pocket | 81.4 upper span, 51.8 diagonal span, R31 and R65 curves |\n| Lower pockets | 28.7 diagonal, 32.2 bottom span, 15.5 perpendicular span; adjacent pocket 18.4 by 14.8 |\n| End link | R30 inner curve, R59.4 outer curve; 2.5 inset on each side |\n| Rounding | R5 inside pockets; R0.5 exterior edges; 5 main rim width; 30° and 60° rib directions |\n\nThe stacked spans are totals between opposing outer faces: `24 = 7 + 10 + 7`, `25 = 2.5 + 20 + 2.5`, and `29 = 24 + 2.5 + 2.5`. The 40 dimension runs between the large hub’s two end faces and already includes its protrusion beyond the body. The resulting nominal envelope is `198.8 × 74.4 × 40`, derived from the boss diameters and centre positions. No bolt circle or counterbore is shown.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"build123d","tool":"execute","arguments":{"code":"from build123d import *\nimport math\n# Printed dimension table, mm unless noted\nhub_od = 55.0 # mm\nhub_id = 40.0 # mm\nhub_width = 40.0 # mm\nboss_od = 20.0 # mm\nboss_id = 13.0 # mm\nboss_count = 3\nlower_x = 104.1 # mm\nlower_y = -18.5 # mm\nupper_x = 123.2 # mm\nupper_y = 35.9 # mm\nend_x = 161.3 # mm\nend_y = 20.4 # mm\nbody_width = 24.0 # mm\nweb_width = 10.0 # mm\npocket_depth = 7.0 # mm\nlower_boss_width = 29.0 # mm\nend_boss_width = 25.0 # mm\nlink_width = 20.0 # mm\nlink_inset = 2.5 # mm\nrim_width = 5.0 # mm\npocket_radius = 5.0 # mm\nexterior_radius = 0.5 # mm\nmain_top_span = 81.4 # mm\nmain_diag_span = 51.8 # mm\nmain_left_radius = 31.0 # mm\nmain_bottom_radius = 65.0 # mm\nlower_diag_span = 28.7 # mm\nlower_bottom_span = 32.2 # mm\nlower_normal_span = 15.5 # mm\nright_diag_span = 18.4 # mm\nright_normal_span = 14.8 # mm\nlink_inner_radius = 30.0 # mm\nlink_outer_radius = 59.4 # mm\nrib_angle = 30.0 # degrees\ncross_rib_angle = 60.0 # degrees\n# Undimensioned construction controls, inferred from form, not pixel scaling\nupper_pocket_angle = 10.0 # degrees\nbottom_rail_y = -25.0 # mm\nsmall_root_x = 58.0 # mm\nright_wall_x = 108.0 # mm\njoining_overlap = 2.0 # mm\nradial_hole_d = 4.0 # mm, visible undimensioned lubrication hole\nhub_r = hub_od/2\nboss_r = boss_od/2\nlower_c = Vector(lower_x,lower_y,0)\nupper_c = Vector(upper_x,upper_y,0)\nend_c = Vector(end_x,end_y,0)\norigin = Vector(0,0,0)\n\ndef face_edges(edges):\n    return Face(Wire(edges))\ndef prism(face,width):\n    return Pos(0,0,-width/2)*extrude(face,amount=width)\ndef tangent_points(c0,r0,c1,r1,side):\n    d=c1-c0\n    u=d.normalized()\n    v=Vector(-u.Y,u.X,0)\n    s=(r0-r1)/d.length\n    n=u*s+v*(side*math.sqrt(1-s*s))\n    return c0+n*r0,c1+n*r1\n# Main body tangent-sided casting, with real curved hub boundaries\nat,bt=tangent_points(origin,hub_r,upper_c,boss_r,1)\nab,bb=tangent_points(origin,hub_r,lower_c,boss_r,-1)\nmain_face=face_edges([Edge.make_line(at,bt),Edge.make_line(bt,upper_c),Edge.make_line(upper_c,lower_c),Edge.make_line(lower_c,bb),Edge.make_line(bb,ab),Edge.make_line(ab,at)])\nbody=prism(main_face,body_width)\n# Curved end link: concentric-shape recipe using radius-constrained arcs\nlink_top_a=upper_c+Vector(0,boss_r,0)\nlink_top_b=end_c+Vector(boss_r*math.sin(math.radians(rib_angle)),boss_r*math.cos(math.radians(rib_angle)),0)\nlink_bottom_b=end_c+Vector(0,-boss_r,0)\nlink_bottom_a=upper_c+Vector(0,-boss_r,0)\nlink_face=face_edges([RadiusArc(link_top_a,link_top_b,link_outer_radius),Edge.make_line(link_top_b,link_bottom_b),RadiusArc(link_bottom_b,link_bottom_a,-link_inner_radius),Edge.make_line(link_bottom_a,link_top_a)])\nbody=body.fuse(prism(link_face,link_width))\nbody=body.fuse(Cylinder(hub_r,hub_width))\nfor c,w in [(lower_c,lower_boss_width),(upper_c,end_boss_width),(end_c,end_boss_width)]:\n    body=body.fuse(Pos(c)*Cylinder(boss_r,w))\nresult=body\nshow(result,'bracket')"},"result":null,"error":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
